{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "33b11aa2-0283-8f0b-95db-a6a57f0a50a5",
  "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:38:51-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Anabela Andrade",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:37:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:37:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, um, yes, hello. My name is Anabela Andrade. I'm calling because, well, the trash truck broke my bin this morning. The recycling bin, the blue one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:37:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sorry to hear that. Broke how, exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:37:33-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, the lid snapped off and there's a big crack down the side. I think the arm grabbed it wrong and it, it just cracked. I saw it when I came out to get it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:37:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, got it. Lid off, cracked side, recycling bin. What's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:37:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 12 Malbone Road. In the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:37:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "12 Malbone, great. I'm putting that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:37:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And, um, is there a fee? For a new one? Because I rent, so I wasn't sure who pays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:38:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not that I'm aware of for a bin the truck damaged. I'll note it as crew damage and we'll get a replacement out to you. Might take a few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:38:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so, well, thank you. Can I just put it out next week anyway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:38:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, if it still holds together, go ahead. Otherwise just set the recycling in a box that day and we'll take that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:38:24-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:38:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll do my best to get that moving for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:38:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait, you'll do your best? So you're saying no? You won't replace it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:38:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, sorry, that came out wrong. Yes, we're replacing it. It's just a figure of speech. It's going on the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:38:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Okay, good, I thought you were refusing. Sorry. Um, thank you then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:38:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:38:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
